.*
!.gitignore
!.github
!.agents
# Cargo output of every crate, including the separate `fuzz` workspace.
target/
# The fuzz targets are an opt-in development tool, resolved on demand.
crates/ananicy-platform/fuzz/Cargo.lock
result
# `make install` generates the unit from data/ananicy-rs.service.in. It is a
# build product, in the source tree or not.
data/ananicy-rs.service
# Vendored Cargo dependency trees, generated on demand by the contrib packaging
# recipes. See contrib/README.md; each is a build input of a package, not source.
contrib/debian/vendor.tar.xz
contrib/fedora/*-vendor.tar.xz
contrib/archlinux/vendor/
